#: admin_custom/models.py:23
msgid "Something else"
msgstr "अरू केही"

#: admin_custom/reports.py:32
msgid "What’s the problem?"
msgstr "के समस्या छ?"

#: admin_custom/reports.py:34
msgid "Tell us more"
msgstr "थप बताउनुहोस्"

#: admin_custom/reports.py:35
msgid ""
"What’s wrong and where. For a copyright claim: which work is yours, where it "
"was first published, and confirm that you own it or act for the owner."
msgstr ""
"के गलत छ र कहाँ। प्रतिलिपि अधिकारको दाबीका लागि: कुन काम तपाईंको हो, पहिले कहाँ "
"प्रकाशित भयो, र त्यो तपाईंको हो वा तपाईं मालिकका तर्फबाट हुनुहुन्छ भनी पुष्टि गर्नुहोस्।"

#: admin_custom/reports.py:38 pitches/forms.py:37 pitches/forms.py:95
msgid "Your name"
msgstr "तपाईंको नाम"

#: admin_custom/reports.py:39 pitches/forms.py:38 pitches/forms.py:96
msgid "Your email"
msgstr "तपाईंको इमेल"

#: admin_custom/reports.py:40
msgid ""
"So we can tell you what we did. Required for copyright and privacy reports."
msgstr ""
"हामीले के गर्‍यौं भनी जानकारी दिन। प्रतिलिपि अधिकार र गोपनीयता उजुरीका लागि अनिवार्य।"

#: admin_custom/reports.py:56
msgid "Please describe the problem so we can act on it."
msgstr "कारबाही गर्न सकियोस् भनेर समस्या वर्णन गर्नुहोस्।"

#: admin_custom/reports.py:59
msgid "We need a way to reach you about this kind of report."
msgstr "यस्तो उजुरीका लागि तपाईंलाई सम्पर्क गर्ने उपाय चाहिन्छ।"

