#: templates/editorial_board/public_page.html:36
msgid "Evidence-based health news and knowledge for Nepal."
msgstr "नेपालका लागि प्रमाणमा आधारित स्वास्थ्य समाचार र ज्ञान।"

#: templates/editorial_board/public_page.html:39
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Much of the health information people in Nepal see online has never been "
"checked against the evidence, while important research stays locked in "
"technical language. %(JOURNAL_NAME)s exists to close that gap: we turn "
"medical evidence into accurate, clear and practical information, without "
"lowering the standards of journalism, research ethics or professional "
"accountability."
msgstr ""
"नेपालमा मानिसहरूले अनलाइन देख्ने धेरैजसो स्वास्थ्य जानकारी कहिल्यै प्रमाणसँग जाँचिएको हुँदैन, "
"अर्कोतर्फ महत्त्वपूर्ण अनुसन्धान प्राविधिक भाषामै सीमित रहन्छ। यही खाडल पुर्न "
"%(JOURNAL_NAME)s स्थापना भएको हो: पत्रकारिता, अनुसन्धान नैतिकता र पेसागत "
"जवाफदेहिताको मापदण्ड नघटाई हामी चिकित्सकीय प्रमाणलाई सही, स्पष्ट र व्यावहारिक "
"जानकारीमा बदल्छौँ।"

#: templates/editorial_board/public_page.html:42
msgid ""
"We publish health news, explainers, research summaries and analysis in "
"Nepali and English, alongside a peer-reviewed scientific journal. Formal "
"submission and peer review for the journal take place on OJS (Open Journal "
"Systems), a dedicated scholarly publishing platform; accepted papers are "
"published here with plain-language summaries."
msgstr ""
"हामी नेपाली र अंग्रेजीमा स्वास्थ्य समाचार, व्याख्यात्मक सामग्री, अनुसन्धान सारांश र विश्लेषण "
"प्रकाशित गर्छौँ, साथै एउटा समकक्षी-समीक्षित वैज्ञानिक जर्नल पनि। जर्नलका लागि औपचारिक "
"पेस र समकक्षी समीक्षा विद्वत् प्रकाशनका लागि बनेको OJS (Open Journal Systems) "
"प्लेटफर्ममा हुन्छ; स्वीकृत लेखहरू यहाँ सरल भाषाको सारांशसहित प्रकाशित हुन्छन्।"

#: templates/editorial_board/public_page.html:47
msgid "OUR VISION"
msgstr "हाम्रो दृष्टि"

#: templates/editorial_board/public_page.html:48
msgid ""
"To become Nepal's most trusted evidence-based health and medical knowledge "
"platform, advancing medical education, healthcare, science communication and "
"public health awareness through research-driven information, credible "
"journalism and academic publishing."
msgstr ""
"अनुसन्धानमा आधारित जानकारी, विश्वसनीय पत्रकारिता र प्राज्ञिक प्रकाशनमार्फत चिकित्सा "
"शिक्षा, स्वास्थ्य सेवा, विज्ञान सञ्चार र जनस्वास्थ्य चेतनालाई अघि बढाउँदै नेपालको सबैभन्दा "
"भरपर्दो प्रमाणमा आधारित स्वास्थ्य तथा चिकित्सा ज्ञान प्लेटफर्म बन्ने।"

#: templates/editorial_board/public_page.html:51
msgid "OUR MISSION"
msgstr "हाम्रो ध्येय"

#: templates/editorial_board/public_page.html:52
msgid ""
"To reduce misinformation in healthcare and medical education by turning "
"scientific evidence, health research and medical knowledge into accurate, "
"accessible content for the Nepali public, health professionals, students, "
"researchers and policymakers."
msgstr ""
"वैज्ञानिक प्रमाण, स्वास्थ्य अनुसन्धान र चिकित्सा ज्ञानलाई नेपाली जनता, स्वास्थ्यकर्मी, "
"विद्यार्थी, अनुसन्धानकर्ता र नीति निर्माताका लागि सही र सहज सामग्रीमा बदलेर स्वास्थ्य "
"सेवा र चिकित्सा शिक्षामा फैलिने भ्रामक सूचना घटाउने।"

#: templates/editorial_board/public_page.html:57
msgid "How we work"
msgstr "हामी कसरी काम गर्छौँ"

#: templates/editorial_board/public_page.html:59
msgid "Evidence first."
msgstr "प्रमाण पहिले।"

#: templates/editorial_board/public_page.html:59
msgid ""
"We rely on peer-reviewed research and authoritative sources such as WHO, "
"NHRC, MoHP, MEC, PubMed, The Lancet, BMJ and NEJM, and we cite them."
msgstr ""
"हामी समकक्षी-समीक्षित अनुसन्धान र WHO, NHRC, MoHP, MEC, PubMed, The Lancet, BMJ "
"र NEJM जस्ता आधिकारिक स्रोतमा भर पर्छौँ, र तिनको उल्लेख गर्छौँ।"

#: templates/editorial_board/public_page.html:60
msgid "Checked before it's published."
msgstr "प्रकाशनअघि जाँच।"

#: templates/editorial_board/public_page.html:60
msgid ""
"Editorial review, fact-checking and source verification, with corrections "
"made openly."
msgstr "सम्पादकीय समीक्षा, तथ्य जाँच र स्रोत प्रमाणीकरण, अनि खुला रूपमा सच्याइ।"

#: templates/editorial_board/public_page.html:61
msgid "Clear and local."
msgstr "स्पष्ट र स्थानीय।"

#: templates/editorial_board/public_page.html:61
msgid ""
"Technical findings in simple, practical language, focused on Nepal's own "
"health priorities."
msgstr ""
"नेपालकै स्वास्थ्य प्राथमिकतामा केन्द्रित रहेर प्राविधिक निष्कर्षहरू सरल, व्यावहारिक भाषामा।"

#: templates/editorial_board/public_page.html:62
msgid "Independent."
msgstr "स्वतन्त्र।"

#: templates/editorial_board/public_page.html:62
msgid ""
"Editorial decisions are ours alone; advertisers and partners have no say in "
"what we cover."
msgstr ""
"सम्पादकीय निर्णय हाम्रो मात्र हो; हामी के समेट्छौँ भन्नेमा विज्ञापनदाता र साझेदारको "
"भूमिका हुँदैन।"

#: templates/editorial_board/public_page.html:67
msgid "Areas we focus on"
msgstr "हाम्रा मुख्य विषयक्षेत्र"

#: templates/editorial_board/public_page.html:79
msgid "Who it's for"
msgstr "कसका लागि"

#: templates/editorial_board/public_page.html:80
msgid ""
"Health professionals, researchers, students, educators, policymakers and the "
"public: one place where people who usually work in separate information "
"worlds can share and use the same evidence."
msgstr ""
"स्वास्थ्यकर्मी, अनुसन्धानकर्ता, विद्यार्थी, शिक्षक, नीति निर्माता र आम जनता: प्रायः "
"छुट्टाछुट्टै सूचना संसारमा काम गर्ने मानिसहरूले एउटै प्रमाण साझा गर्न र प्रयोग गर्न सक्ने एउटै "
"ठाउँ।"

#: templates/editorial_board/public_page.html:84
msgid "What we publish"
msgstr "हामी के प्रकाशित गर्छौँ"

#: templates/editorial_board/public_page.html:157
#, python-format
msgid ""
"%(JOURNAL_NAME)s is committed to evidence, transparency and accountability. "
"These policies set out how we choose and check what we publish, how we stay "
"independent, how we correct mistakes, and how our peer-reviewed journal "
"works."
msgstr ""
"%(JOURNAL_NAME)s प्रमाण, पारदर्शिता र जवाफदेहिताप्रति प्रतिबद्ध छ। हामी प्रकाशित "
"गर्ने सामग्री कसरी छान्छौँ र जाँच्छौँ, कसरी स्वतन्त्र रहन्छौँ, गल्ती कसरी सच्याउँछौँ, र हाम्रो "
"समकक्षी-समीक्षित जर्नल कसरी चल्छ भन्ने कुरा यी नीतिहरूले बताउँछन्।"

